intended:
设 $\boldsymbol{A}， \boldsymbol{B}$ 均为 2 阶矩阵， $\boldsymbol{A}^*， \boldsymbol{B}^*$ 分别为 $\boldsymbol{A}， \boldsymbol{B}$ 的伴随矩阵， 若 $|\boldsymbol{A}|=2，|\boldsymbol{B}|=3$， 则分块矩阵 $\left(\begin{array}{ll}\boldsymbol{O} & \boldsymbol{A} \\ \boldsymbol{B} & \boldsymbol{O}\end{array})$ 的伴随矩阵为
A. $(\begin{array}{cc}\boldsymbol{O} & 3 \boldsymbol{B}^* \\ 2 \boldsymbol{A}^* & \boldsymbol{O}\end{array})$;
B. $(\begin{array}{cc}O & 2 B^* \\ 3 A^* & O\end{array})$;
C. $(\begin{array}{cc}\boldsymbol{O} & 3 \boldsymbol{A}^* \\ 2 \boldsymbol{B}^* & \boldsymbol{O}\end{array})$;
D. $(\begin{array}{cc}\boldsymbol{O} & 2 \boldsymbol{A}^* \\ 3 \boldsymbol{B}^* & \boldsymbol{O}\end{array})$

sequential_substitution:
设 $\boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}\boldsymbol{O} & 3 \boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}O & 2 B^* \\ 3 A^* & O\end{array})$;^* \\ 2 \boldsymbol{A}^* & \boldsymbol{O}\end{array})$;， \boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}O & 2 B^* \\ 3 A^* & O\end{array})$;$ 均为 2 阶矩阵， $\boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}\boldsymbol{O} & 3 \boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}O & 2 B^* \\ 3 A^* & O\end{array})$;^* \\ 2 \boldsymbol{A}^* & \boldsymbol{O}\end{array})$;^*， \boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}O & 2 B^* \\ 3 A^* & O\end{array})$;^*$ 分别为 $\boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}\boldsymbol{O} & 3 \boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}O & 2 B^* \\ 3 A^* & O\end{array})$;^* \\ 2 \boldsymbol{A}^* & \boldsymbol{O}\end{array})$;， \boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}O & 2 B^* \\ 3 A^* & O\end{array})$;$ 的伴随矩阵， 若 $|\boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}\boldsymbol{O} & 3 \boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}O & 2 B^* \\ 3 A^* & O\end{array})$;^* \\ 2 \boldsymbol{A}^* & \boldsymbol{O}\end{array})$;|=2，|\boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}O & 2 B^* \\ 3 A^* & O\end{array})$;|=3$， 则分块矩阵 $\left(\begin{array}{ll}\boldsymbol{O} & \boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}\boldsymbol{O} & 3 \boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}O & 2 B^* \\ 3 A^* & O\end{array})$;^* \\ 2 \boldsymbol{A}^* & \boldsymbol{O}\end{array})$; \\ \boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}O & 2 B^* \\ 3 A^* & O\end{array})$; & \boldsymbol{O}\end{array})$ 的伴随矩阵为
A. $(\begin{array}{cc}\boldsymbol{O} & 3 \boldsymbol$(\begin{array}{cc}O & 2 B^* \\ 3 A^* & O\end{array})$;^* \\ 2 \boldsymbol{A}^* & \boldsymbol{O}\end{array})$;
B. $(\begin{array}{cc}O & 2 B^* \\ 3 A^* & O\end{array})$;
C. $(\begin{array}{cc}\boldsymbol{O} & 3 \boldsymbol{A}^* \\ 2 \boldsymbol{B}^* & \boldsymbol{O}\end{array})$;
D. $(\begin{array}{cc}\boldsymbol{O} & 2 \boldsymbol{A}^* \\ 3 \boldsymbol{B}^* & \boldsymbol{O}\end{array})$
